{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2022-08-31 09:00:00', 'title': 'KRAFT HEINZ TO PARTICIPATE AT 2022 BARCLAYS GLOBAL CONSUMER STAPLES CONFERENCE', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) (“KRAFT HEINZ”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT MIGUEL PATRICIO, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND CHAIR OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS; ANDRE MACIEL, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND GLOBAL CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER; AND CARLOS ABRAMS-RIVERA, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND PRESIDENT, NORTH AMERICA ZONE, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE BARCLAYS GLOBAL CONSUMER STAPLES CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, SEPT. 7, 2022. THE SESSION WILL BEGIN AT 9:45'}